  "description": "QOMCUQ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C84 H188 B40 Cl14 Li4 O10 Si4 Sm6. From the CIF bond table, Sm1 (Sm) has 1 O neighbors; Sm2 (Sm) has 2 O neighbors; Sm3 (Sm) has 1 O neighbors; Sm2B (Sm) has 2 O neighbors; Sm1B (Sm) has 1 O neighbors; Sm3B (Sm) has 1 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 11 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.618-4.001 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 103.75-113.56°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C84H188B40Cl14Li4O10Si4Sm6. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ4-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
